<title>USA: Virco sets quarterly cash div policy.</title>
<headline>Virco sets quarterly cash div policy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virco Manufacturing Corp said Wednesday its board had voted to initiate a quarterly cash dividend policy.</p>
<p>Virco previously paid an annual cash dividend.</p>
<p>The company said that beginning with the payment date of January 31, a $0.025 a share cash dividend will be paid to holders of record December 30.</p>
<p>Virco said the amount of the quarterly dividend will be reviewed each quarter in the light of the company's earnings and liquidity.</p>
</text>
